    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414460/extras/e8e51e626f498fca9e48df89802126f0.poster.avif?t=1750010257\" width=600 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414460/extras/e8e51e626f498fca9e48df89802126f0.webm?t=1750010257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pizza Super Slice</strong> is a <i><strong>cartoon-exploration-platformer</strong></i> in which you play as an animated pizza slice. Explore a strange, cartoonish town full of little secrets, dark corners and secret passages.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414460/extras/02690475717635c01690bb5e011c1aa3.poster.avif?t=1750010257\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414460/extras/02690475717635c01690bb5e011c1aa3.webm?t=1750010257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414460/extras/02690475717635c01690bb5e011c1aa3.mp4?t=1750010257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore a hand-drawn town full of strange characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >enjoyable platforming that takes into account many hidden mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >uncover the secrets of Meat Peninsula in a psychedelic cartoon adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >original soundtrack consisting of selected representatives of the heavy underground scene</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414460/extras/e8e51e626f498fca9e48df89802126f0.poster.avif?t=1750010257\" width=600 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414460/extras/e8e51e626f498fca9e48df89802126f0.webm?t=1750010257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pizza Super Slice</strong> is a <i><strong>cartoon-exploration-platformer</strong></i> in which you play as an animated pizza slice. Explore a strange, cartoonish town full of little secrets, dark corners and secret passages.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414460/extras/02690475717635c01690bb5e011c1aa3.poster.avif?t=1750010257\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414460/extras/02690475717635c01690bb5e011c1aa3.webm?t=1750010257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414460/extras/02690475717635c01690bb5e011c1aa3.mp4?t=1750010257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore a hand-drawn town full of strange characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >enjoyable platforming that takes into account many hidden mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >uncover the secrets of Meat Peninsula in a psychedelic cartoon adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >original soundtrack consisting of selected representatives of the heavy underground scene</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Cartoon-exploration-platformer in which you play as an living slice of pizza. Explore a strange, cartoon town full of little secrets, dark corners and secret passages. There's something interesting in every nook and cranny!",
